---
import Profile from "../layouts/Profile.astro";
import FieldPlate from "../components/FieldPlate.astro";
---

<Profile
  slug="speaker"
  related={["spiritual-mentor", "quantum-physicist", "author"]}
>
  <Fragment slot="intro">
    At a whiteboard, I can draw a chain of sites and ask a room where an
    electron might go. In a{" "}
    <a href="https://masterwithin.net/class/">Living Wisdom class</a>, we start
    with a passage in Bengali or Hindi. A good first question in either room is
    which word or idea needs a closer look.
  </Fragment>
  <div slot="lead" class="profile-actions">
    <a
      class="profile-button"
      href="mailto:founder@vishwavigyan.com?subject=Speaking%20invitation"
    >
      Invite me to speak
    </a>
    <a href="#watch">Listen first ↓</a>
  </div>
  <FieldPlate
    slot="plate"
    photo="talk-whiteboard"
    label="Teaching / At the board"
    caption="Working through an idea with a microphone in one hand and a marker in the other."
  />
  <section class="folio-row">
    <div>
      <span class="stamp">For a student audience</span>
      <h2>Start with an experiment</h2>
    </div>
    <div>
      <p>
        Where does a wave go if it can move more easily to the right than to the
        left? A sketch and a few adjustable bars give a room something to argue
        about before we introduce the equations.
      </p>
      <a href="/quantum-physicist/#student">
        Try the wave model from my research page →
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="folio-row" id="watch">
    <div>
      <span class="stamp">For a listening audience</span>
      <h2>Hear the conversation</h2>
    </div>
    <div>
      <p>
        Find recorded talks on the{" "}
        <a href="https://www.youtube.com/@MasterWithinOfficial">
          Master Within YouTube channel
        </a>
        . For a live session,{" "}
        <a href="https://masterwithin.net/class/">Living Wisdom</a> is our
        weekly reading of Thakur’s words. First-time listeners are welcome.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="folio-row">
    <h2>What would your audience ask?</h2>
    <div>
      <p>
        For a science session, a motivational talk or a conversation about
        spiritual practice, tell me who will be there, their language, your date
        and one question you’d like them to leave thinking about.
      </p>
      <a href="mailto:founder@vishwavigyan.com?subject=Speaking%20invitation">
        Send a speaking invitation →
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Profile>
